 "hast": "\n<p>You can use the <code>shadcn</code> CLI to run your own code registry. Running your own registry allows you to distribute your custom components, hooks, pages, config, rules and other files to any project.</p>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"Callout\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[]\"><p><strong>Note:</strong> The registry works with any project type and any framework, and is\nnot limited to React.</p></mdx-jsx>\n<mdx-jsx data-name=\"figure\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;flex flex-col gap-4&#x22;}]\"><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/registry-light.png&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;1432&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;960&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Registry&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border dark:hidden&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"Image\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;src&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;/images/registry-dark.png&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;width&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;1432&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;height&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;960&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;alt&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;Registry&#x22;},{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;mt-6 hidden w-full overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border shadow-sm dark:block&#x22;}]\"></mdx-jsx><mdx-jsx data-name=\"figcaption\" data-flow=\"true\" data-attrs=\"[{&#x22;name&#x22;:&#x22;className&#x22;,&#x22;value&#x22;:&#x22;text-center text-sm text-gray-500&#x22;}]\"><p>A distribution system for code</p></mdx-jsx></mdx-jsx>\n<p>Ready to create your own registry? In the next section, we'll walk you through setting up your own custom registry step-by-step, from cr